PrimaryDecomposition -- primary decomposition and associated primes routines for ideals and modules
***************************************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides routines for computation involving components of ideals
and modules, including associated primes and primary decompositions.

The following simple example illustrates the use of *note
removeLowestDimension: removeLowestDimension,, *note topComponents:
topComponents,, *note radical: (MinimalPrimes)radical,, *note minimalPrimes:
(MinimalPrimes)minimalPrimes,, *note associatedPrimes: associatedPrimes,, and
*note primaryDecomposition: primaryDecomposition,.

