+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = monomialCurveIdeal(R,{1,3,4})                                       |
|                                                                             |
|                        3      2     2    2    3    2                        |
|o2 = ideal (b*c - a*d, c  - b*d , a*c  - b d, b  - a c)                      |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
