|i2 : I = intersect(ideal(x_0,x_1,x_2,x_3), ideal(x_4,x_5,x_6,x_7), ideal(x_0,|
|                                                                             |
|o2 = ideal (x x , x x , x x , x x , x x , x x , x x , x x , x x , x x , x x ,|
|             2 7   0 7   3 6   2 6   1 6   0 6   2 5   0 5   3 4   2 4   1 4 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     x x )                                                                   |
|      0 4                                                                    |
