Strategy => ShimoyamaYokoyama
=============================

This strategy is the default for non-monomial ideals. See Localization and
Primary Decomposition of Polynomial ideals by Shimoyama and Yokoyama, J. Symb.
Comp. 22, 247-277 (1996).

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
