|                                                                             |
|                                                2              2   2         |
|o6 = {ideal (d, a), ideal (c, b), ideal (b, a, d ), ideal (d, c , a ), ideal |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|          2   2                                                              |
|     (b, d , c )}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : List                                                                    |
